"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:\'微软雅黑\'; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Training Set Creation</p>\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">1. Unlabeled dataset</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Image path</span>: Click &quot;Open&quot; to select the folder path where the 3D Tif format files are located.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Save path</span>: Click &quot;Open&quot; to select the save path. After starting the process, click &quot;Look&quot; to view the path.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Prediction model</span>: Dropdown options. Click to select the prediction model. You can choose a self-trained model or import the model address.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Click &quot;Start Making&quot; to start dataset creation.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">2. Dataset with Labels</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Image path</span>: Click &quot;Open&quot; to select the folder path where the 3D Tif format files are located.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Label path</span>: Click &quot;Open&quot; to select the folder path where the labels are located.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Save path</span>: Click &quot;Open&quot; to select the save path. After starting the process, click &quot;Look&quot; to view the path. </p>\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">3. BV format data</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Image path</span>: Click &quot;Open&quot; to select the folder path where the BV format data file (including config.cfg) is located.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Save path</span>: Click &quot;Open&quot; to select the save path. After starting the process, click &quot;Look&quot; to view the path.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Prediction model</span>: Dropdown options. Click to select the prediction model. You can choose a self-trained model or import the model address.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Level</span>: Downsampling level. The lower the level, the higher the resolution.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Click &quot;Start Making&quot; to start the data set production. </p>\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Training Set Count</span>: Set the approximate number of blocks for filtering the data set.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Parallel Count</span>: Set the number of threads for extracting the features of the data set. The default is 5 threads, which approximately occupies 2GB of memory.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Size(XYZ)</span>: Set the size of the data blocks of the training data set. For the vascular training set, the default is x:y:z = 272:272:144.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Division(train:val:test)</span>: Set the division ratio of the training set, validation set, and test set of the training data set.</p>\n"
