"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Configuration File</span>: Click &quot;Open&quot; to select a Json format configuration file. If a saved model was generated during the previous model training, the configuration file path will be automatically filled.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">Save Path</span>: Click &quot;Open&quot; to select the folder path where the prediction results will be saved.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#ffcf0f;\">BV ROI Region</span>: Set the ROI region range in BV format. The default setting is to take the maximum range.</p>\n"
